  author =       "Alexandru Sava and Paul Uiuiu and C{\u{a}}lin La{\c{t}}iu and Daniel Cocan and George-C{\u{a}}t{\u{a}}lin Muntean and Tudor Papuc and Andrada Ihu{\c{t}} and Camelia R{\u{a}}ducu and Anca Becze and Cristina Craioveanu and Camelia Munteanu and Radu Constantinescu and Vioara Mire{\c{s}}an",
